^{:go/end 89} (go/method OnName "OnName rewrites \"dependent\" and SIMD names to their architecture-specific version.\n" ^{:tag (* syntax/Name)} [^{:tag (* DeepCopier)} c ^{:tag (* syntax/Name)} id]
